  "doveTrovoGpx": "Where do I find a GPX?",
  "sitoGaraSpessoC": "• Race website: there's often \"Download GPX track\".\n• Strava, Komoot, Garmin Connect: open a route or an activity → Export GPX.\n• A friend: they can send you the GPX of their activity.\nThen here: Add GPX and choose the file.",
